<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 21.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 21.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 21	     April 18</p>
<p>Fed acct			 6.777		  4.997</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  35.183		 20.991</p>
<p>Cash balance		  41.960		 25.988</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,266.644	     5,264.901</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $43 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
